 section of it; template(deep-house, @tempest_such_stuff).night: a canned section, sung with that phrase; a theme of the public-domain library: a line, in the program's key; a phrasebook line: a phrase, for sing and template; genre@1 techno.drop: a section of a genre template, frozen)."}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"use_source"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf":[{"@value":"stored | gen | \"template\" \"(\" NAME { \",\" binding } \")\" [ \".\" NAME ] | template \".\" NAME | \"theme\" NAME | \"phrase\" PHRASE | GENRE NAME \".\" NAME"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#grammarSection":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radio: stations"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status":[{"@value":"stable"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesKeyword":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-phrase"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-symbol-close-paren"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-symbol-comma"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-symbol-dot"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-symbol-open-paren"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-template"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-theme"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesProduction":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-binding"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-gen"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-stored"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-template"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesToken":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/token-genre"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/token-name"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/token-phrase"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#writtenAs":[{"@value":"use_source"}]},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-use","http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type":[{"@id":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The use production of BeatScript's grammar (the program is private: it may use restricted assets; a name for a source, written out where it is used (docs/beatscript/ext-roles.md))."}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"use"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf":[{"@value":"\"use\" \"restricted\" | \"use\" use_source \"as\" NAME"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#grammarSection":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radio: stations"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status":[{"@value":"stable"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesKeyword":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-as"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-restricted"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-use"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesProduction":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-use-source"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesToken":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/token-name"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#writtenAs":[{"@value":"use"}]},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-value","http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type":[{"@id":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The value production of BeatScript's grammar (a control's value may read inputs: 200 + knob(3) * 7800)."}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"value"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf":[{"@value":"carith"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#grammarSection":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Control: what the mix does"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status":[{"@value":"stable"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesProduction":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-carith"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#writtenAs":[{"@value":"value"}]},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-wave","http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type":[{"@id":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The wave production of BeatScript's grammar."}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"wave"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf":[{"@value":"\"sine\" | \"tri\" | \"square\" | \"saw\""}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#grammarSection":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Shapes and lfo"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status":[{"@value":"stable"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#usesKeyword":[{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-saw"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-sine"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-square"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/keyword-tri"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#writtenAs":[{"@value":"wave"}]},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-weight","http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type":[{"@id":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"},{"@id":"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The weight production of BeatScript's grammar."}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"weight"}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf":[{"@value":"NUMBER | \"(\" arith \")\""}],"https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#grammarSection":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Degrees, Roman numerals, chance"}],"https://beatscri